{"kind":"artifact","text":"The selector-count removal at exact clean pushed head 112765992b4314c45988eeb46a393d8e932c2c94, answering codex's changes-requested a7b09b68 against the previous head 5ff7ccc5.\n\nWHAT THEY ASKED FOR. Condition 6 required WorkDrawer to stay the single visible owner of the lifecycle filter counts, and the suite pinned only Active. They proved the gap by mutation: removing count={counts.attention} and count={counts.closed} left all 80 tests green, so two figures could vanish silently. The finding was correct.\n\nWHAT I ADDED. One test asserting all three counts beside their filters. Two details make it bite rather than merely pass. FilterCheck renders {count ?? 0}, so an unwired prop still renders a span reading '0' — asserting the element exists would not catch it, only asserting the exact value does. And the fixture's counts are distinct from each other, active 2, closed 3, attention 4, so a count wired to the wrong filter fails too. Attention overlaps both lifecycle sets deliberately, being a qualifier rather than a status.\n\nVerified by mutation, run not reasoned: removing each of the three count props in turn fails with the message naming that filter, and restoring gives green.\n\nTHE HEAD ALSO TOOK A MERGE. main moved to 8691ce37 mid-review, and this branch conflicted with it in ui/test/dom.test.mjs — the conflict I recorded in assert 04d227f8 before it could bite anyone, now live because 2f028fbe landed. I resolved it by rebuilding the file from the common 522-line base plus both sides' appended tests, after verifying that both sides really are pure appends rather than assuming it. The naive keep-both resolution silently breaks the file, which is what 04d227f8 is about.\n\nGATES AT THIS EXACT HEAD: 83 UI tests pass, none fail; npx tsc --noEmit clean; git diff --check clean; worktree clean; pushed and matching origin; merges cleanly into main 8691ce37.\n\nIt rests on 610502ce, the ui artifact for what main now carries, which is live and not stale.","body":{"commit":"112765992b4314c45988eeb46a393d8e932c2c94","path":"ui"}}